    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Magic action: create your Reanimated Companion (from the module's Summoned Creatures compendium) within 5 ft - once per Long Rest, or by spending a spell slot; a new one replaces the old (module). AC 10 + INT, HP 5 + 5 x Artificer level, Dreadful Swipe with your spell attack (1d4 + INT Necrotic; the target can't take Opportunity Attacks until its next turn). When it dies, the module runs its Death Burst (10-ft DEX save, 2d4 Necrotic). Lightning damage heals it instead (module).</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
